{"title":"Updates","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/910437968/0/marginalrevolution~Updates.html","date":1736005885000,"content":"<p>In a justified resurgence of interest in the topic, The Telegraph <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/Telegraph/status/1875452454520668385\" target=\"_blank\">covers the Rotherham scandals</a>.  Liz Truss <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/trussliz\" target=\"_blank\">has spoken up too</a>.  This is not a welcome issue <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/search?q=starmer&amp;src=typed_query\" target=\"_blank\">for Starmer</a>, to say the least.  No matter what you think he did/did not do wrong in this matter, he cannot come out ahead.  One implication is that ethnic enclaves sometimes are a big mistake, and that suburban sprawl is underrated.  Note that Pakistanis in the United States have <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?q=pakistanis+in+usa+per+capita+income&amp;sca_esv=7d58c79c5b6bab2d&amp;source=hp&amp;ei=yFR5Z7naNPeliLMP-92d2Ao&amp;iflsig=AL9hbdgAAAAAZ3li2FwSenydqSFGG3i4-ZS2QhVPc0tR&amp;ved=0ahUKEwi53tfvsdyKAxX3EmIAHftuB6sQ4dUDCBk&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=pakistanis+in+usa+per+capita+income&amp;gs_&amp;sclient=gws-wiz\" target=\"_blank\">median income above the U.S. average</a>, and comparable to other Asians.</p>\r\n<p>Elsewhere, Thierry Breton <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/thierrybreton/status/1875482430955532694?s=46&amp;t=-\" target=\"_blank\">remains an Ayn Rand villain</a>.</p>\r\n<p>That’s all.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/updates-2.html\">Updates</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/910437968/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/910437968/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/910437968/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/910437968/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/910437968/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/910437968/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/updates-2.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/updates-2.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/updates-2.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/updates-2.html#comment-160855868\">In reply to Now explain Jimmy Savile.   That has been converted ...</a> <i>by Ben</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/updates-2.html#comment-160855735\">In reply to Balsac T Baghard.   Thanks. You just proved you are ...</a> <i>by Donald Pretari</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/updates-2.html#comment-160855602\">In reply to rsm.   The last time cities all but disappeared ...</a> <i>by JonFraz</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevo